lumn-3\">6:59 p.m.</td><td class=\"column-4\">6:59 p.m.</td><td class=\"column-5\">6:59 p.m.</td><td class=\"column-6\">6:59 p.m.</td><td class=\"column-7\">6:59 p.m.</td><td class=\"column-8\">6:59 p.m.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"row-12\">\n\t<td class=\"column-1\">Treasure Hunt</td><td class=\"column-2\">1:35 p.m.</td><td class=\"column-3\">1:35 p.m.</td><td class=\"column-4\">1:35 p.m.</td><td class=\"column-5\">1:35 p.m.</td><td class=\"column-6\">1:35 p.m.</td><td class=\"column-7\">1:35 p.m.</td><td class=\"column-8\">1:35 p.m.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"row-13\">\n\t<td class=\"column-1\">Powerball</td><td class=\"column-2\"></td><td class=\"column-3\"></td><td class=\"column-4\"></td><td class=\"column-5\">10:59 p.m.</td><td class=\"column-6\"></td><td class=\"column-7\"></td><td class=\"column-8\">10:59 p.m.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"row-14\">\n\t<td class=\"column-1\">Mega Millions</td><td class=\"column-2\"></td><td class=\"column-3\"></td><td class=\"column-4\">11:00 p.m.</td><td class=\"column-5\"></td><td class=\"column-6\"></td><td class=\"column-7\">11:00 p.m.</td><td class=\"column-8\"></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"row-15\">\n\t<td class=\"column-1\">Cash4Life</td><td class=\"column-2\">9:00 p.m.</td><td class=\"column-3\">9:00 p.m.</td><td class=\"column-4\">9:00 p.m.</td><td class=\"column-5\">9:00 p.m.</td><td class=\"column-6\">9:00 p.m.</td><td class=\"column-7\">9:00 p.m.</td><td class=\"column-8\">9:00 p.m.</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n\n</div>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>*All times are displayed in Pennsylvania local time.</p>\n<h2><br></h2>\n<h2>Advance Draws</h2>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Number of consecutive draws each Pennsylvania State Lottery games allows you to play:</p>\n<p><br></p>\n\n<table id=\"tablepress-AdvancedDraws-no-4\" class=\"tablepress tablepress-id-AdvancedDraws tablepress-responsive\">\n<thead>\n<tr class=\"row-1\">\n\t<th class=\"column-1\">Game</th><th class=\"column-2\">Advanced Draws</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody class=\"row-striping row-hover\">\n<tr class=\"row-2\">\n\t<td class=\"column-1\">Pick 2 Day</td><td class=\"column-2\">up to 7</td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"row-3\">\n\t<td class=\"column-1\">Pick 2 Evening</td><td class=\"column-2\">up to 7</td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"row-4\">\n\t<td class=\"column-1\">Pick 3 Day</td><td class=\"column-2\">up to 7</td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"row-5\">\n\t<td class=\"column-1\">Pick 3 Evening</td><td class=\"column-2\">up to 7</td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"row-6\">\n\t<td class=\"column-1\">Pick 4 Day</td><td class=\"column-2\">up to 7</td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"row-7\">\n\t<td class=\"column-1\">Pick 4 Evening</td><td class=\"column-2\">up to 7</td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"row-8\">\n\t<td class=\"column-1\">Pick 5 Day</td><td class=\"column-2\">up to 7</td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"row-9\">\n\t<td class=\"column-1\">Pick 5 Evening</td><td class=\"column-2\">up to 7</td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"row-10\">\n\t<td class=\"column-1\">Cash 5</td><td class=\"column-2\">up to 7</td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"row-11\">\n\t<td class=\"column-1\">Match 6</td><td class=\"column-2\">up to 26</td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"row-12\">\n\t<td class=\"column-1\">Treasure Hunt</td><td class=\"column-2\">up to 7</td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"row-13\">\n\t<td class=\"column-1\">Powerball</td><td class=\"column-2\">up to 26</td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"row-14\">\n\t<td class=\"column-1\">Mega Millions</td><td class=\"column-2\">up to 26</td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"row-15\">\n\t<td class=\"column-1\">Cash4Life</td><td class=\"column-2\">up to 10</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n\n<h2><br></h2>\n<h2>Tax Information</h2>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Pennsylvania Lottery Federal, and state tax withholdings on winnings for U.S. citizens or residents.&nbsp;</p>\n<p><br></p>\n\n<table id=\"tablepress-USResidentsTax-no-4\" class=\"tablepress tablepress-id-USResidentsTax tablepress-responsive\">\n<thead>\n<tr class=\"row-1\">\n\t<th class=\"column-1\">Winnings</th><th class=\"column-2\">Tax Category</th><th class=\"column-3\">Percentage</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody class=\"row-striping row-hover\">\n<tr class=\"row-2\">\n\t<td class=\"column-1\">Over $5,000</td><td class=\"column-2\">State Tax</td><td class=\"column-3\">3.1%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"row-3\">\n\t<td class=\"column-1\">Over $5,000</td><td class=\"column-2\">Federal Tax</td><td class=\"column-3\">24.0%</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n\n<p><br></p>\n<p>If the winner is not a U.S. citizen or is not a US resident, Pennsylvania Lottery tax withholdings on winnings are as such:&nbsp;</p>\n<p><br></p>\n\n<table id=\"tablepress-NonUSTax-no-4\" class=\"tablepress tablepress-id-NonUSTax tablepress-responsive\">\n<thead>\n<tr class=\"row-1\">\n\t<th class=\"column-1\">Winnings</th><th class=\"column-2\">Tax Category</th><th class=\"column-3\">Percentage</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody class=\"row-striping row-hover\">\n<tr class=\"row-2\">\n\t<td class=\"column-1\">Over $5,000</td><td class=\"column-2\">State Tax</td><td class=\"column-3\">3.1%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"row-3\">\n\t<td class=\"column-1\">Over $5,000</td><td class=\"column-2\">Federal Tax</td><td class=\"column-3\">30.0%</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n\n<figure><br></figure>\n<figure>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"800\" height=\"382\" src=\"/wp-media/wp-content/uploads/2020/12/pennesvlynia.jpg\" alt=\"pennesvlynia lottery\" loading=\"lazy\" srcset=\"/wp-media/wp-content/uploads/2020/12/pennesvlynia.jpg 894w, /wp-media/wp-content/uploads/2020/12/pennesvlynia-300x143.jpg 300w, /wp-media/wp-content/uploads/2020/12/pennesvlynia-768x367.jpg 768w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 800px) 100vw, 800px\"><p></p>\n<figcaption></figcaption>\n</figure>\n<h2><br></h2>\n<h2>About the Pennsylvania Lottery</h2>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>The Pennsylvania state lottery was established in 1971, and ticket sales for a $50 000 jackpot game commenced in 1972. The proceeds of the lottery go towards programs in support of the elderly. The lottery in Pennsylvania has raised $29 billion for programs related to senior care.&nbsp;You don’t need to wait for retirement to play, as 18 is the lottery’s legal age.&nbsp;</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Most players chase the big jackpots of Mega Millions and Pennsylvania lottery Powerball. Other great titles also have enthusiastic followers. These include Match 6, Cash4Life, Cash 5, Pick 5, Pick 4, Pick 3, and Pick 2.</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p></p>\n<p>The Pennsylvania State Lottery has an impressive selection of scratch games, known as scratch-offs in this state. You can pick them up for anything from $1 to $20, and they yield prizes from $5000 to $1 million. Fast Play &#8211; Active Games are also played online. These are similar to scratch-offs but without the need to scratch.&nbsp;Forever innovative, this lottery also has a virtual sports offering.&nbsp;</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>This lets you bet on virtual horses or virtual cars on Xpress Sports. Pennsylvania Lucky for Life is known as Cash4Life, but the fantastic weekly income is the same.</p>\n<h2><br></h2>\n<h2>Pennsylvania Lottery FAQ</h2>\n<p><br></p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"has_eae_slider elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-4766974 elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-eae-slider=\"45699\" data-id=\"4766974\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-e-type=\"section\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"has_eae_slider elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-4b4bbce\" data-eae-slider=\"11481\" data-id=\"4b4bbce\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-e-type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-7becae6 elementor-widget elementor-widget-eael-adv-accordion\" data-id=\"7becae6\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"eael-adv-accordion.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t            <div class=\"eael-adv-accordion\" id=\"eael-adv-accordion-7becae6\" data-scroll-on-click=\"no\" data-scroll-speed=\"300\" data-accordion-id=\"7becae6\" data-accordion-type=\"accordion\" data-toogle-speed=\"300\">\n            <div class=\"eael-accordion-list\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div id=\"what-are-the-requirements-to-buy-lottery-tickets-in-pennsylvania\" class=\"elementor-tab-title eael-accordion-header\" tabindex=\"0\" data-tab=\"1\" aria-controls=\"elementor-tab-content-1291\"><span class=\"eael-advanced-accordion-icon-closed\"><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-accordion-icon fas fa-plus\"></i></span><span class=\"eael-advanced-accordion-icon-opened\"><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-accordion-icon fas fa-minus\"></i></span><span class=\"eael-accordion-tab-title\">What Are the Requirements to Buy Lottery Tickets in Pennsylvania?</span><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-toggle fas fa-angle-right\"></i></div><div id=\"elementor-tab-content-1291\" class=\"eael-accordion-content clearfix\" data-tab=\"1\" aria-labelledby=\"what-are-the-requirements-to-buy-lottery-tickets-in-pennsylvania\"><p>Players over 18 can buy tickets and Pennsylvania lottery scratch cards and register with iLottery. Online purchase of lottery tickets is impossible, but registering an account gives you access to iLottery games that you can play for money. You can also play these games on the Pennsylvania lottery app.</p><p>The app provides info on Pennsylvania lottery results and Pennsylvania lottery codes. It also acts as a Pennsylvania lottery ticket scanner that lets you check your tickets.</p></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div><div class=\"eael-accordion-list\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div id=\"what-lottery-games-can-you-play-in-pennsylvania\" class=\"elementor-tab-title eael-accordion-header\" tabindex=\"0\" data-tab=\"2\" aria-controls=\"elementor-tab-content-1292\"><span class=\"eael-advanced-accordion-icon-closed\"><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-accordion-icon fas fa-plus\"></i></span><span class=\"eael-advanced-accordion-icon-opened\"><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-accordion-icon fas fa-minus\"></i></span><span class=\"eael-accordion-tab-title\">What Lottery Games Can You Play in Pennsylvania?</span><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-toggle fas fa-angle-right\"></i></div><div id=\"elementor-tab-content-1292\" class=\"eael-accordion-content clearfix\" data-tab=\"2\" aria-labelledby=\"what-lottery-games-can-you-play-in-pennsylvania\"><p>In addition to the statewide games like Powerball and Pennsylvania lottery Mega Millions, the lottery in Pennsylvania offers seven different games. These are as follows: </p><p>Match 6 lets you select six numbers from 1 to 49, while in Cash4Life you have to select five numbers from 1 to 60. Cash 5 requires five numbers from 1 to 43. Pick 5, Pick 4, Pick 3 and Pick 2 requires different play styles as part of your betting. For the most part though, it’s about picking the number of digits required in the name and adding your personal touch.</p></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div><div class=\"eael-accordion-list\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div id=\"where-and-how-do-i-claim-winnings-from-the-pennsylvania-lottery\" class=\"elementor-tab-title eael-accordion-header\" tabindex=\"0\" data-tab=\"3\" aria-controls=\"elementor-tab-content-1293\"><span class=\"eael-advanced-accordion-icon-closed\"><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-accordion-icon fas fa-plus\"></i></span><span class=\"eael-advanced-accordion-icon-opened\"><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-accordion-icon fas fa-minus\"></i></span><span class=\"eael-accordion-tab-title\">Where and How Do I Claim Winnings from the Pennsylvania Lottery?</span><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-toggle fas fa-angle-right\"></i></div><div id=\"elementor-tab-content-1293\" class=\"eael-accordion-content clearfix\" data-tab=\"3\" aria-labelledby=\"where-and-how-do-i-claim-winnings-from-the-pennsylvania-lottery\"><p>When the Pennsylvania lottery numbers match your selection, it’s time to claim. Winners can claim all prizes up to $2500 at participating retailers, or by mail. Prizes over $2500 require completing a claim form that winners mail to the lottery with the signed ticket.</p><p>Players can claim Jackpot prizes for Powerball, Mega Millions, and Cash4Life in person at lottery headquarters. Claims generally expire about one year after the draw or the end-sale date. Your check should reach you in four weeks.</p></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div><div class=\"eael-accordion-list\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div id=\"what-are-the-odds-of-winning-the-pennsylvania-lottery\" class=\"elementor-tab-title eael-accordion-header\" tabindex=\"0\" data-tab=\"4\" aria-controls=\"elementor-tab-content-1294\"><span class=\"eael-advanced-accordion-icon-closed\"><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-accordion-icon fas fa-plus\"></i></span><span class=\"eael-advanced-accordion-icon-opened\"><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-accordion-icon fas fa-minus\"></i></span><span class=\"eael-accordion-tab-title\">What Are the Odds of Winning the Pennsylvania Lottery?</span><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-toggle fas fa-angle-right\"></i></div><div id=\"elementor-tab-content-1294\" class=\"eael-accordion-content clearfix\" data-tab=\"4\" aria-labelledby=\"what-are-the-odds-of-winning-the-pennsylvania-lottery\"><p>Winning the Mega Millions jackpot comes at odds of 1 in 302 million. In the case of Powerball, it’s 1 in 175 million. Other odds are as follows:</p><p> </p><p>Match 6: 1 in 4.6 million</p><p>Cash4Life: 1 in 21.9 million</p><p>Cash 5: 1 in 962 598</p><p>Pick 5: 1 in 100 000</p><p>Pick 4: 1 in 10 000</p><p>Pick 3: 1 in 1000</p><p>Pick 2: 1 in 100</p></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div><div class=\"eael-accordion-list\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div id=\"whats-the-biggest-pennsylvania-lottery-win\" class=\"elementor-tab-title eael-accordion-header\" tabindex=\"0\" data-tab=\"5\" aria-controls=\"elementor-tab-content-1295\"><span class=\"eael-advanced-accordion-icon-closed\"><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-accordion-icon fas fa-plus\"></i></span><span class=\"eael-advanced-accordion-icon-opened\"><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-accordion-icon fas fa-minus\"></i></span><span class=\"eael-accordion-tab-title\">What’s the Biggest Pennsylvania Lottery Win?</span><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-toggle fas fa-angle-right\"></i></div><div id=\"elementor-tab-content-1295\" class=\"eael-accordion-content clearfix\" data-tab=\"5\" aria-labelledby=\"whats-the-biggest-pennsylvania-lottery-win\"><p>In 2018, a Powerball ticket bought in Manheim, Lancaster County, won a $456.7 million jackpot.  The name of the individual is not known. The prize was claimed by the Emerald Legacy Trust, created by the winner for anonymity.</p></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div><div class=\"eael-accordion-list\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div id=\"when-is-the-pennsylvania-lottery-results-draw\" class=\"elementor-tab-title eael-accordion-header\" tabindex=\"0\" data-tab=\"6\" aria-controls=\"elementor-tab-content-1296\"><span class=\"eael-advanced-accordion-icon-closed\"><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-accordion-icon fas fa-plus\"></i></span><span class=\"eael-advanced-accordion-icon-opened\"><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-accordion-icon fas fa-minus\"></i></span><span class=\"eael-accordion-tab-title\">When Is the Pennsylvania Lottery Results Draw?</span><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-toggle fas fa-angle-right\"></i></div><div id=\"elementor-tab-content-1296\" class=\"eael-accordion-content clearfix\" data-tab=\"6\" aria-labelledby=\"when-is-the-pennsylvania-lottery-results-draw\"><p>The results of the Pennsylvania Lottery become available as follows:</p><p> </p><p>Match 6: Daily at 6:59 pm</p><p>Cash4Life: Mondays and Thursdays at 9 pm </p><p>Cash 5: Daily at 6:59 pm</p><p>Pick 5, Pick 4, Pick 3, and Pick 2: Daily at 1:35 pm and 6:59 pm</p></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div><div class=\"eael-accordion-list\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div id=\"what-is-the-pennsylvania-lottery-second-chance\" class=\"elementor-tab-title eael-accordion-header\" tabindex=\"0\" data-tab=\"7\" aria-controls=\"elementor-tab-content-1297\"><span class=\"eael-advanced-accordion-icon-closed\"><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-accordion-icon fas fa-plus\"></i></span><span class=\"eael-advanced-accordion-icon-opened\"><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-accordion-icon fas fa-minus\"></i></span><span class=\"eael-accordion-tab-title\">What Is the Pennsylvania Lottery Second Chance?</span><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-toggle fas fa-angle-right\"></i></div><div id=\"elementor-tab-content-1297\" class=\"eael-accordion-content clearfix\" data-tab=\"7\" aria-labelledby=\"what-is-the-pennsylvania-lottery-second-chance\"><p>Players access Pennsylvania lottery Second Chance through the VIP Players Club. Club members have more opportunities to win from previously</p><p>non-winning tickets. You can use the Pennsylvania lottery app to scan tickets to enter them for Second Chance.</p></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div><div class=\"eael-accordion-list\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div id=\"do-i-have-to-pay-tax-on-pennsylvania-lottery-winnings\" class=\"elementor-tab-title eael-accordion-header\" tabindex=\"0\" data-tab=\"8\" aria-controls=\"elementor-tab-content-1298\"><span class=\"eael-advanced-accordion-icon-closed\"><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-accordion-icon fas fa-plus\"></i></span><span class=\"eael-advanced-accordion-icon-opened\"><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-accordion-icon fas fa-minus\"></i></span><span class=\"eael-accordion-tab-title\">Do I Have to Pay Tax on Pennsylvania Lottery Winnings?</span><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-toggle fas fa-angle-right\"></i></div><div id=\"elementor-tab-content-1298\" class=\"eael-accordion-content clearfix\" data-tab=\"8\" aria-labelledby=\"do-i-have-to-pay-tax-on-pennsylvania-lottery-winnings\"><p>For wins over $5,000, Pennsylvania Lottery winners pay a state tax of 3.07% and the standard federal tax of 24%</p></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div></div>\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"has_eae_slider elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-5ccf034 elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-eae-slider=\"47969\" data-id=\"5ccf034\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-e-type=\"section\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"has_eae_slider elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-22b407f\" data-eae-slider=\"46592\" data-id=\"22b407f\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-e-type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-31d6804 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"31d6804\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Got more questions about the Pennsylvania Lottery? </p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"has_eae_slider elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-2df1a0a\" data-eae-slider=\"81910\" data-id=\"2df1a0a\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-e-type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-e972a26 elementor-button-success elementor-align-center elementor-widget elementor-widget-button\" data-id=\"e972a26\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"button.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-button-w